    "body": "## Scope\nRussian player-facing interface and readable outcome summary for the local two-player Chat03 harness in this Draft PR.\n\n- All visible browser UI, statuses, and safe errors are in Russian; document language is `ru`.\n- The page shows each player’s actions and attack/defense strengths without raw JSON or synthetic participant IDs.\n- A/B perspective is derived from the server public view’s synthetic participant IDs and fails closed if the mapping is missing or inconsistent.\n- The harness continues to submit the original color and action codes unchanged. No approved readable expansions for N/P/T and S/C/G are present in this API, so the UI labels them as variants and states that limitation instead of inventing meanings.\n- The existing loopback API boundary, CSP, separate A/B bearer credentials, page-memory-only token handling, and server-side admin secret handling remain unchanged.\n\n## Checkpoint\n- Base: `main@31b7a077820914e92de81239e5ab4099e3dfa558`.\n- Branch: `codex/chat03-two-player-local-harness-20261028`.\n- Current exact PR HEAD: `8b681b9e5e36d7ede209fa46bd204b2bbdbf9b48`.\n- The two localization commits continue directly from the existing `220de5d` checkpoint; no history rewrite or force push.\n- The PR has 11 changed paths, all within the original local harness, its focused tests, ignored local secrets, and its focused CI workflow.\n\n## Validation on exact HEAD\n- Focused Node tests: 11/11 PASS.\n- JavaScript syntax checks for the client, presentation module, and tests: PASS.\n- Chat 03B2 Private Gameplay API run #95: SUCCESS, including the focused harness tests and isolated local Worker/D1 integration.\n- Chat 03B1 Gameplay CAS SQL run #160: SUCCESS.\n- AI Forensics run #1884: SUCCESS.\n- Independent review of the UI, presentation, and test changes: PASS.\n- No browser or Safari acceptance has been performed. Keep this PR Draft pending the owner’s two-window local Safari check.\n\n## Explicitly out of scope\nNo Stage 7.15 onboarding/runtime, Worker, SQL or D1 schema changes; no Cloudflare API, hosted Worker/D1, production, deployment, telemetry, or main writes. No PR merge.",
